---
// src/components/CreativeProjects.astro
---

<div class="bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-12 flex flex-col items-center justify-between text-center shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden group h-full transition-transform hover:-translate-y-2">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-500/5 to-transparent opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
    
    <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center h-full">
        <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-[10px] mb-5 border border-blue-400/30 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-400/10">Taller de Ideas</span>
        <h3 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-display font-bold text-white uppercase mb-4">Mundo <br/><span class="text-blue-400">Creativo</span></h3>
        
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-8 text-sm flex-grow">
            No es solo para jugar, es un taller de creatividad, arte, ingeniería y diseño. Desde mega-construcciones hasta sistemas de redstone complejos. Es el espacio donde las ideas se desarrollan antes del Survival.
        </p>
        
        <a href="/maps/creative" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-blue-400 font-bold text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest hover:text-white transition-colors bg-blue-500/10 px-6 py-4 rounded-xl border border-blue-500/20 hover:bg-blue-500/30 w-full mt-auto">
            Ver Mapa Interactivo <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path></svg>
        </a>
    </div>
</div>